- slug: {{ $('🔧 Prepare Blog Data').item.json.slug }}
- category: {{ $('🔧 Prepare Blog Data').item.json.category }}
- coverImage: {{ $('🔧 Prepare Blog Data').item.json.coverImage }}
- author: PulseBot

Requirements:
1. Start with --- frontmatter (title, date, slug, description, tags, category, coverImage, author, readTime)
2. 800-1200 words
3. H2 and H3 headings
4. One <Callout type="info"> block
5. One <Chart type="bar" title="Growth" data={[{name:"2022",value:40},{name:"2023",value:65},{name:"2024",value:89},{name:"2025",value:120}]} />
6. Output ONLY raw MDX, nothing else, starting with ---
